### ==================== SPRINTS ====================

### Listar todos los sprints
GET http://localhost/scrum_microservices/back/retros_ms/public/sprints
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Crear un sprint
POST http://localhost/scrum_microservices/back/retros_ms/public/sprints
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nombre": "Sprint 1",
    "fecha_inicio": "2026-11-20",
    "fecha_fin": "2026-12-04"
}

###

### Actualizar un sprint
PUT http://localhost/scrum_microservices/back/retros_ms/public/sprints/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nombre": "Sprint 1 - Revisado",
    "fecha_inicio": "2026-11-20",
    "fecha_fin": "2026-12-06"
}

###

### Eliminar un sprint
DELETE http://localhost/scrum_microservices/back/retros_ms/public/sprints/1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### ==================== RETROS ====================

### Listar todos los ítems de retrospectiva
GET http://localhost/scrum_microservices/back/retros_ms/public/retros
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Obtener un ítem de retro por ID
GET http://localhost/scrum_microservices/back/retros_ms/public/retros/1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Crear un ítem de retro (tipo acción)
POST http://localhost/scrum_microservices/back/retros_ms/public/retros
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "sprint_id": 1,
    "categoria": "accion",
    "descripcion": "Mejorar la cobertura de pruebas unitarias",
    "cumplida": false,
    "fecha_revision": "2026-12-04"
}

###

### Crear un ítem de retro (tipo logro)
POST http://localhost/scrum_microservices/back/retros_ms/public/retros
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "sprint_id": 1,
    "categoria": "logro",
    "descripcion": "Se entregó el módulo de autenticación a tiempo"
}

###

### Crear un ítem de retro (tipo impedimento)
POST http://localhost/scrum_microservices/back/retros_ms/public/retros
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "sprint_id": 1,
    "categoria": "impedimento",
    "descripcion": "El servidor de staging estuvo caído 2 días"
}

###

### Actualizar un ítem de retro
PUT http://localhost/scrum_microservices/back/retros_ms/public/retros/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "categoria": "accion",
    "descripcion": "Mejorar cobertura de pruebas al 80%",
    "cumplida": false,
    "fecha_revision": "2026-12-10"
}

###

### Evaluar una acción (marcar como cumplida)
PATCH http://localhost/scrum_microservices/back/retros_ms/public/retros/1/evaluar
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "cumplida": true,
    "fecha_revision": "2026-12-04"
}

###

### Eliminar un ítem de retro
DELETE http://localhost/scrum_microservices/back/retros_ms/public/retros/1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### ==================== RETROS POR SPRINT ====================

### Listar retros de un sprint específico
GET http://localhost/scrum_microservices/back/retros_ms/public/sprints/1/retros
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Listar solo las acciones de un sprint
GET http://localhost/scrum_microservices/back/retros_ms/public/sprints/1/acciones
Content-Type: application/json
